# Keep line endings sane across the Windows-authoring / Linux-running split.
# Shell scripts, YAML and the SQL schema are executed on Linux and must be LF,
# or bash chokes on \r and Postgres/rpk mis-parse.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.tpl text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
